  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to agree, to consent, to approve",
      "explanation": "To express agreement with an opinion, proposal, or course of action."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "06056_douisuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "その{意見|いけん}に{同意|どうい}する。",
      "english": "I agree with that opinion.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06056_douisuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{全員|ぜんいん}が{計画|けいかく}に{同意|どうい}した。",
      "english": "Everyone agreed to the plan.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06056_douisuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{利用規約|りようきやく}に{同意|どうい}してください。",
      "english": "Please agree to the terms of service.",
      "notes": "Common in digital contexts",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06056_douisuru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{条件|じょうけん}に{同意|どうい}できない{場合|ばあい}は、お{知|し}らせください。",
      "english": "If you cannot consent to the conditions, please let us know.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06056_douisuru_ex5",
      "japanese": "{長|なが}い{話|はな}し{合|あ}いの{末|すえ}に、ようやく{両者|りょうしゃ}が{同意|どうい}に{達|たっ}した。",
      "english": "After a long discussion, both parties finally reached an agreement.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Pattern: Xに{同意|どうい}する (agree to/with X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates state. {同意|どうい}している = 'agrees' or 'has agreed.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{提案|ていあん}に{同意|どうい}する (agree to a proposal)\n・{条件|じょうけん}に{同意|どうい}する (consent to conditions)\n・{同意|どうい}を{得|え}る (obtain consent)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS: {賛成|さんせい}する emphasizes supporting/approving, while {同意|どうい}する emphasizes having the same opinion or giving consent.",
